{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In Switzerland,",
   "start": 0.09,
   "end": 0.92
  },
  {
   "text": "it is illegal to own just one guinea pig.",
   "start": 1.05,
   "end": 3.39
  },
  {
   "text": "The reason?",
   "start": 3.86,
   "end": 4.39
  },
  {
   "text": "It might get lonely.",
   "start": 4.8,
   "end": 5.72
  },
  {
   "text": "Since 2008,",
   "start": 6.21,
   "end": 7.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Swiss law says social animals need a friend of their own kind.",
   "start": 7.35,
   "end": 10.68
  },
  {
   "text": "You can love it and talk to it every day.",
   "start": 11.13,
   "end": 13.09
  },
  {
   "text": "Doesn't count.",
   "start": 13.5,
   "end": 14.03
  },
  {
   "text": "But guinea pigs rarely pass away together.",
   "start": 14.44,
   "end": 16.5
  },
  {
   "text": "So when one goes,",
   "start": 16.87,
   "end": 17.92
  },
  {
   "text": "the owner is suddenly breaking the law.",
   "start": 18.08,
   "end": 20.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Buy a young one,",
   "start": 20.46,
   "end": 21.25
  },
  {
   "text": "and the cycle never ends.",
   "start": 21.41,
   "end": 22.75
  },
  {
   "text": "Enter Priska.",
   "start": 23.24,
   "end": 24.14
  },
  {
   "text": "A schoolteacher,",
   "start": 24.53,
   "end": 25.26
  },
  {
   "text": "who lives with 80 guinea pigs.",
   "start": 25.44,
   "end": 27.08
  },
  {
   "text": "She runs a rentaguineapig service.",
   "start": 27.46,
   "end": 29.28
  },
  {
   "text": "Your lonely pet gets a roommate.",
   "start": 29.63,
   "end": 31.12
  },
  {
   "text": "And when its time comes,",
   "start": 31.48,
   "end": 32.54
  },
  {
   "text": "the roommate goes home.",
   "start": 32.71,
   "end": 33.74
  },
  {
   "text": "She even plays matchmaker.",
   "start": 34.13,
   "end": 35.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Sometimes a tired old grandpa gets a young friend,",
   "start": 35.83,
   "end": 38.392
  },
  {
   "text": "and feels young again.",
   "start": 38.392,
   "end": 39.49
  },
  {
   "text": "A whole country made sure no guinea pig is ever alone.",
   "start": 39.87,
   "end": 43.11
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody wrote that law for people.",
   "start": 43.51,
   "end": 45.03
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 45.42,
   "end": 46.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is always there,",
   "start": 47.21,
   "end": 48.924
  },
  {
   "text": "so you're never the only one.",
   "start": 48.924,
   "end": 50.11
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 50.5,
   "end": 52.1
  }
 ]
}